Canonical runtime

```text
Frame object and invariants
→ select genuinely distinct routes
→ encode into shared Relational IR
→ render independently
→ decode without forcing agreement
→ score each rendering
→ compute pairwise deltas
→ compute deltas-of-deltas
→ distinguish complement, contradiction, artifact, and hidden variable
→ synthesize while retaining dissent and provenance
→ test against reality and a null
→ promote surviving operators
→ write result and lineage to Mother Duck
→ recurse across tasks, states, bodies, and domains
```

